# Board-side NPU bundle: vendor runtime, a prebuilt model and the vendor demos,
# all copied out of rknn-toolkit2 rather than authored here. About 23MB, and
# reconstructible - see the "npu-a17" section of
# armbian/.kiro/board-changes/rk3588-evb7-v11.md for what goes in it and the
# toolchain that builds the C++ parts.
npu-a17/
# Everything tests/run.sh generates: the functions it extracts from the real
# sources with awk, and the binaries built from them. Derived, and deliberately
# so - a committed copy of an extracted function is a copy that goes stale
# silently, which is the failure mode the extraction exists to avoid.
tests/build/
